%% Handler routing diagram
flowchart TD
    Update[Update] --> Dispatcher
    Dispatcher -->|command /start| CmdHandler[Command Handler]
    Dispatcher -->|callback query| CbHandler[Callback Query Handler]
    Dispatcher -->|text message| MsgHandler[Message Handler]
    CmdHandler -->|executes| CommandLogic
    CbHandler -->|executes| CallbackLogic
    MsgHandler -->|executes| MessageLogic